Date: Wed, 17 Feb 2021 15:59:28 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 25/68] Ignore warnings from Groovy when running Java 8

Groovy logs exceptions on Java 8 because it can't enable Java 9 features (which is fine).

See also https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/GROOVY-9933
---
 .../fixtures/executer/AbstractGradleExecuter.java     | 11 +++++++++++
 1 file changed, 11 insertions(+)

diff --git a/subprojects/internal-integ-testing/src/main/groovy/org/gradle/integtests/fixtures/executer/AbstractGradleExecuter.java b/subprojects/internal-integ-testing/src/main/groovy/org/gradle/integtests/fixtures/executer/AbstractGradleExecuter.java
